## LineItem

Shared line-item field for commercial documents: description, quantity, unit price (base `AmountWithCurrency`). Line totals are computed, never stored.

```ts
import { LineItem } from '../blocks/commerce/line-item';
@field lineItems = containsMany(LineItem);
```

Consumed by both Invoice and Order — the block's two-consumer proof.

**Non-goals:** per-line tax and discounts; multi-currency within one document (first line's currency wins for totals).
